		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-16bd5f3 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="16bd5f3" data-element_type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c04e866 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="c04e866" data-element_type="widget" id="location" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<h5 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Google Location Of Emporio Tower</h5>		</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b8dadc7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="b8dadc7" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: #ffffff;">Malad West is a leading residential zone in with 1, 2bhk homes in Mumbai &amp; 3bhk homes in Mumbai and lies between Andheri and Dahisar. Demand for property in Malad West has gone up by leaps and bounds with developments in infrastructure and overall connectivity improvements.</span></p>						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5785287 elementor-widget elementor-widget-google_maps" data-id="5785287" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="google_maps.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<style>/*! elementor - v3.21.0 - 18-04-2024 */
.elementor-widget-google_maps .elementor-widget-container{overflow:hidden}.elementor-widget-google_maps .elementor-custom-embed{line-height:0}.elementor-widget-google_maps iframe{height:300px}</style>		<div class="elementor-custom-embed">
			<iframe loading="lazy"
					src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=EMPORIO%20TOWERS%2C%20Kandivali%2C%20Charkop%2C%20Sector%202%20Charkop%2C%20Kandivali%20West%2C%20Mumbai%2C%20Maharashtra%20400067&#038;t=m&#038;z=16&#038;output=embed&#038;iwloc=near"
					title="EMPORIO TOWERS, Kandivali, Charkop, Sector 2 Charkop, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400067"
					aria-label="EMPORIO TOWERS, Kandivali, Charkop, Sector 2 Charkop, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400067"
			></iframe>
		</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5f98f99 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="5f98f99" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Emporio Tower Brief</h2>		</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-02a8454 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="02a8454" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: #ffffff;">Emporio Towers by Sangam Developers Kandivali is one of the most sought after new projects in Charkop for those who are looking for low-cost apartments. It is a new launch project. Sangam Emporio Tower possession will begin in aug, 2024. There are 1BHK, 2BHK and 3BHK Apartments for sale, coming up in this project. Emporio Towers Western Mumbai is a RERA-registered project with registration number P51800031000. Sangam Emporio Tower Charkop has 4 towers, with 22 floors each and 204 units on offer. Spread over an area of 0.93 acres, Emporio Tower Charkop is one of the spacious projects in the Western Mumbai region. With all the basic amenities available, Emporio Tower Charkop fits into your budget and your lifestyle.</span></p>						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-15c77bd elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="15c77bd" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">About Sangam Developers</h2>		</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-404567b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="404567b" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: #ffffff;">One of the most prominent real estate sangam Developers was incorporated in 1980. Sangam developers is a well-regarded, reputed player in the Indian real estate sector with over 35<strong>+</strong> years of experience in this field &amp; 20+ Property Delivered.</span></p>						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8d8356b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="8d8356b" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Emporio Towers Internal Amenities</h2>		</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3112529 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="3112529" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: #ffffff; font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); text-align: var(--text-align); font-size: 1rem;">• </span><span style="color: #ffffff;">Flooring : Vitrified tiles of well known brand in living Room, Passage, Bedrooms and Kitchen. • Door : Entrance door with flush door shutters both side laminated with good brass fitting with teak wood doorframes. All other doors teak wood frame and flush door shutters both side laminated. Bathroom And W/C will be provided with water proof flush door. • Windows : Anodised Aluminium sliding windows. • Kitchen : Granite Kitchen Platform with Stainless Steel Sinks. • Platform : Ceramic Tile dado upto full height. All other walls of kitchen with full height of ceramic Tiles. • Toilet: Ceramic tiles flooring full height dado • Bathroom : Concealed plumbing with &#8220;C&#8221; PVC and fittings of reputed brand with adequate points (Plumbing). • Wiring: Concealed copper wiring with Modular switches. A.C. Point in living room and bedrooms. Tube light in each room. Provision for cable connection. Exhaust fan in toilet, bathroom and kitchen. Provision for Gas connection from Mahanagar Gas Ltd. Provision for cable internet connection in each flat. • Paint: P.O.P. finish in all rooms with Internal Lustre paint to all the rooms.</span></p>						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-33d6853 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="33d6853" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Emporio Towers External Amenities</h2>		</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b98cb93 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="b98cb93" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: #ffffff;">• Earthquake resistant design. • Decorative Entrance lobby. • Lifts of reputed brand. • External finishing of the building with paints of reputed brand. • Waterproofing treatment to toilet, bathroom, terrace and external walls. • Chequered tiles in paving and stilt area. • Artistic M.S. Gate. • Pillar light on each entrance gate. • Watchman cabin. • Self-filling pump system in all water tanks. • Video Door Phone. • CCTV Camera • Intercom system in each flat.</span></p>						</div>
